@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 用户信息获取时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/任意受保护页" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "认证控制器\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "JWT 工具\nJwtUtils" as Jwt
database "UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI: 页面进入（需鉴权）
UI -> Axios: GET /api/auth/userinfo\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
Axios -> AuthCtrl: getUserInfo(Authorization)
AuthCtrl -> Jwt: extractUsername(token)
AuthCtrl -> DB: findByUsername(username)
DB --> AuthCtrl: User
AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { id, username, email, displayName, role, authorities, isAdmin, quotaLimit, quotaUsed, createTime, lastLoginTime, ... }
Axios --> UI: 渲染用户信息/权限

note over Security
SecurityConfig 放行 /api/auth/**，但接口内部仍通过 Authorization 解析用户。
end note

@enduml

